==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
{{etymon|en|af|Malays>ethnicity|-ia>country names|id=country|tree=1}}
From {{suffix|en|Malays|-ia}}, amended from the previous form, {{m|en|Malaya}}. The ⟨''{{m|en|-s}}''⟩ was added to honour the inclusion of '''S'''ingapore, '''S'''arawak and North Borneo ('''S'''abah) with Malaya in the formation of ''{{w|Federation of Malaysia|The Federation of Malaysia}}''.

